      "content": "Yeah, the complexity part is what I'm most worried about. It feels like once you start scaling horizontally, there are so many more \"moving parts\" where things can go wrong unexpectedly. Can you give me a few more specific examples of what those \"communication challenges\" or system failures might look like in a real-world production environment?",
